  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 520.03 Application for Walking Disability Plates by a Relative Residing with an Individual with a Walking Disability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 520.03 Application for Walking Disability Plates by a Relative Residing with an Individual with a Walking Disability.\n\n(a) A relative who resides with a person with a walking disability shall complete and submit form RDMV 130 (rev. 8/21).\n\n(b) Each applicant shall sign and date the form under penalty of unsworn falsification.\n\nSource. #7069, eff 8-5-99 (formerly Saf-C 518, see Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #8999, eff 9-29-07; ss by #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 521.04)",
